<div class="related-content-widget">
<div class="related">
<h3>Related&nbsp;Links</h3>
<a class="related-item" href="https://www.un.org/securitycouncil/node/63489/"> Ombudsperson to the ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida Sanctions Committee</a></div>
